#ROOMS

#1500
"Before a Ruined Cathedral"
"The massive, broken gates of a once-mighty cathedral stand open, rotting on

their rusted iron hinges.  The dull howling sound of rushing wind accompanies

stale, warm air which issues from the darkness beyond the gates.  The stones

of the cathedral's construction appear blackened, charred, as if by dragonfire.

"
"extras 'PLANS', 'WEAPONS', 'MOBS' , 'QUESTIONS'

move WEAPONS, etc to be __WEAPONS__, etc

"
301465600 0
12 9 0
D0
""
""
0 -1 1501 0 9
E
"PLANS"
"massive, ruined cathedral modeled after the Wells Cathedral

scissor arch, etc.

the lower levels are demons living in the quarters

the choir and balconies still defended by angels

and archangel in the bell tower

URL: http://www.wellscathedral.org.uk/index.php

good religion: Lonil

- Radiances, the Radiant One, etc

evil religion: temohpab

MAP: http://www.wellscathedral.org.uk/visiting/travel_map_cathedral.shtml

quests for each side

path to west leads along s wall of cloister

leading NPCs will grant flight spell for special quests

"
E
"WEAPONS"
"etheral weapons of Light (Lonil) and Darkness (Temohpab)

-- destoyred on mortal touch, small chance of popping lesser weapon

--- explode on mortal touch of 'wrong' alignment for damage


the light flicker white flame and do additional damage to evil

the dark flicker black flame and do additoinal damage to good

"
E
"MOBS"
"level 55:

lesser Radiance, lesser Darkness

coded as 2353 and 2354 respectively


level 65:

greater Radiance, greater Darkness

greater Darkness coded as 2424


level 75:

named Radiance, Darkness NPCs


"
E
"QUESTIONS"
"Should this be a pkill zone?

How much in the way of questing should happen?

"
A
"__FALL__"
"__CODE__"
"if( !can_fly( ch ) ) {

  rch = mount( ch );

  if( rch ) {

    if( can_fly( rch ) ) {

      end;

      }

    }

  i = 2d10+5;

  dam_message( ch, i, \"the fall\" );

  inflict( ch, null, i, \"the fall\" );

  }

"
!
0 0 0
A
""
""
"continue;

"
E
"to_char"
"You $t $T into the cathedral.

"
E
"to_room"
"$n $t $T into the cathedral.

"
!
3 0 1
-1
