#1501
"Ruined Gates"
"This massive, empty archway of stone once held a pair of magnificent iron

gates, now broken and ruined, warped by fire and rended beyond repair.  To the

north, the archway opens into the mighty nave of a massive cathedral.  To the

south, a path leads away from the gates.

"
"perhaps a vision here of what is going on?

ruined by dragonfire, smashed, rended

"
